SUMMARY:Black Widow: Web of Deceit | Saturday Night
LOCATION:217 Commonwealth Mansion
DESCRIPTION:Category: Holiday\nPrice: $295.00 per person\nAvailability: 1 s
 pot left\nStatus: You are Confirmed\nTime: 8 PM – 1 AM\nEvent URL: https
 ://members.thequinhouse.com/events/202989\n\nSlip into the camouflage of c
 ostume for an evening under the ethereal shadows of lacy silk couture…\n
 \nYou're cordially invited to The ‘Quin’s Annual Halloween Soirée an
  elegant and entangled ticketed affair. \n\nUnder the flicker of flame\, 
 the ‘House will captivate with indulgent buffets\, enchanting performan
 ces\, and the deceivingly translucent jeweled veil - of the spider’s we
 b.\n\nEnsnared? Fall victim.\n\nIn the shadowed corners of the ‘House\,
  become entangled in buffets of culinary bites\, live-action stations\, pa
 ssed delicacies\, and venomous cocktails. A dangerous game of hide-and-see
 k\, spiral the Grand Staircase lured by live musical performances\, shadow
 ed portraitists\, acrobats\, and other-worldly talents...\n\nPerilous vibe
 s take center stage in \n\nBondo \n\nwith a Headline DJ Performance from
  \n\n10:00PM - Midnight\n\nIn the spirit of Halloween\, swarm the ‘Hous
 e.\n\nCreative black tie\, cocktail attire\, or a cleverly crafted costume
  is essential.  \n\nTickets are exclusively available for purchase throug
 h the Member App & Portal beginning September 16th at 10:00AM. Tickets for
  members and their guests are $295* each. To best accommodate members' va
 rying preferences\, we are delighted to extend a limited allocation of up 
 to 1 guest ticket per member for Saturday evening's affair.\n\n*Beverages
  are not included in the ticket price. Beverages will be available for pur
 chase through our masterful team of mixologists. \n\n____________________
 __________________________________\n\nPlease be aware of these important n
 otices:\n\nCANCELLATION POLICY\nKindly note that tickets are non-refundabl
 e and nontransferable once assigned.\n\nENTRY\nAll Member and guest ticket
 s purchased\, are linked to the Member’s profile through the App and Por
 tal and are required for verification and entry on these evenings.\n\nGUES
 T POLICY\nFollowing the regular Member Policy\, Members must arrive and re
 main with their guest(s) at all times. Guests must be age 21+. We strongly
  encourage review of the Members’ Policy to ensure that you and your gue
 st(s) are aware of Club rules.\n\nVALET SERVICES\nValet services will be s
 uspended on the evenings of October 23 & 24. Please plan ahead to secure r
 ideshare services or park at the nearest garage in Back Bay. Metered stree
 t parking is limited but also available.\n\nNO PHOTO POLICY\nPlease be awa
 re that we will offer a photo opportunity on these evenings\; however\, th
 e regular Photo Policy will otherwise be in effect and enforced. Those who
  do not comply with the Privacy Agreement will be asked to leave the Clubh
 ouse in keeping with the standards.\n\nThe ’Quin House has contracted pr
 ofessional photographers and videographers to capture this event. Any phot
 os or videos distributed through ’Quin public channels will be edited to
  conceal the identities of participating Members and their guest(s). Photo
 s or videos that reveal Members will only be used in Member communication 
 with the authorization of those captured.\n\nQuestions? Please contact us 
 at halloween@thequin.com.
